## Function to find the maximum of three numbers
fn max_of_three(a, b, c) =>
  when a >= b and a >= c { a } 
  else when b >= a and b >= c { b } 
  else { c }

## Calling the function with three numbers
val result := max_of_three(15, 25, 10)
shout(result)  ## prints 25
```

