## Function to find the largest of three numbers
fn largestOfThree(nums) =>
  when nums~0 >= nums~1 {
    when nums~0 >= nums~2 {
      nums~0
    } else {
      nums~2
    }
  } else {
    when nums~1 >= nums~2 {
      nums~1
    } else {
      nums~2
    }


## Example usage
val numbers := [5, 10, 3]
val largest := largestOfThree(numbers)
shout(largest)  ## prints 10
```

